          "id": 491749177,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Just looking at the window with a DHCP trace I think \"The DHCP (BOOTP) Statistics window displays the related data.\" Should be changed to something like:\n\"he DHCP (BOOTP) Statistics window displays a table over the number of occurances of a DHCP message type. \n\nI don't think there is a need to put \"WIP\" on every MR if it is OK someone will approve of it's not some one will comment on it. Unless you add something half done which you yourself aim att getting back to with or without feedback. There's a big chance reviewers will not look at a MR in WIP state. At least that's my view.",
